    "directions": [
      "In a bowl add crushed sweet corn kernels, chopped carrot, french beans, green chillies, ginger, toasted sesame seeds, salt, coriander leaves, grated potatoes and mix everything properly until well combined.",
      "Take sliced bread and sprinkle some water on them then spread a big spoonful of the vegetable sesame mixture on the bread properly and evenly.",
      "Now apply sesame seeds on the mixture and shallow fry in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy from both sides.",
      "Remove and cut the edges of the bread and serve in it by cutting in your desired shape with Sesame Garlic Ketchup.",
      "In a pan heat oil and add chopped garlic saute until fragrant.",
      "Now add sesame seeds saute for a few seconds then switch off the flames and add degi red chilli powder mix it once.",
      "Then add water, tomato ketchup and mix everything properly. Keep aside for further use."
    ],
